/crossbreeder-plus
/crossbreeder-plus.exe
/crossbreeder-plus-*
/dist/

# Windows resources are generated per build from versioninfo.json, so that the
# version they carry matches the tag rather than whenever they were last
# committed. Keeping them untracked also keeps the working tree clean at build
# time, which is what lets the binaries report vcs.modified=false.
*.syso
versioninfo.build.json
